# M5 fast development gate (#8683)

Use the **fast M5 presenter** for daily self-host / bootstrap iteration (~1–2 min). Reserve `--strict` for pre-merge bootstrap/gen-0/vendor-prelink PRs.

## Commands

```bash
make north-star5-verify-fast
./script/north-star5-verify.sh --fast
NORTH_STAR5_VERIFY_FAST_GATE=1 ./script/ci-fast.sh   # default on
```

## Fast path checks (read-only)

1. `bootstrap-inventory.php --check`
2. Live spine N/N + `check-selfhost-spine-coverage-sync.php`
3. `bootstrap-vendor-objects.php --check`
4. Prelinked gen-0 + vendor `.o` presence (manifest 3/3 with committed objects)
5. `bootstrap-selfhost-vm-driver-execute-probe.sh --prelinked-only` (~20ms)
6. Spine `bundle OK` from `prelinked/bootstrap-gen0/compiler_lib_aot_blob` (no relink)

## Not in fast path

- Full spine relink (`bootstrap-selfhost-lib-spine-smoke`)
- Vendor AOT `--compile` rebuild
- `north-star5-verify --strict` (~1h) — still required before merging bootstrap/gen-0 changes

## Opt-out

`NORTH_STAR5_VERIFY_FAST_GATE=0 ./script/ci-fast.sh`
